# Out-of-context synth flow under syn/vivado/ leaves per-run artefacts.
# Only the run scripts (run_synth.sh, run_synth.tcl, sweep.sh,
# v80_synth.sh, v80_synth_pnr.tcl, u55c_synth.sh, u55c_synth_pnr.tcl)
# and the curated results markdown (README.md, sweep_results.md) are
# versioned.
